OL,3,GNEWSAResidents feel 'let down' in
OL,4,Atroubled road
OL,5,
OL,6,FBaguley Crescent has long been blighted
OL,7,Fby fly-tipping, a condemned building
OL,8,Fand anti-social behaviour.
OL,10,FI have been reporting on life on this
OL,11,Fsmall Greater Manchester estate -
OL,12,Flocated just off the M60 between
OL,13,FPrestwich and Middleton - for years.
OL,15,FBut what I saw when speaking to some
OL,16,Fsocial housing tenants about a recent
OL,17,Ffire - in which a man in his 60s died -
OL,18,Freally shocked me.
OL,20,FResidents here feel forgotten by the
OL,21,Fvery authorities that are supposed to
OL,22,Flook out for them.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
